%description:
Tests accEcnOptionPolicy="linux", as Linux tcp_ecn_option=2: each segment
after the handshake carries the option, once the peer sent one, as kind 174
(order 1) with each field that fits. The data segments of the client become
12 bytes smaller.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 3000"
*.srv_app.sendScript="2.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.*_tcp.accEcnOptionPolicy = "linux"
*.tcptester.script="a4 ce"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A W ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1013(1012) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0)   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1013 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1013)
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1013:2025(1012) ack 501 win 16384 CE   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)# marking CE
[1.407 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 2025 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=1012,e0b=1013)
[1.409 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 2025:3001(976) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0)   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
[1.611 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N ack 3001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=1012,e0b=1989)
[2.001 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A W N 501:1501(1000) ack 3001 win 16384 ECT(0)   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=1012,e0b=1989)
[2.203 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N ack 1501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1001)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
